  "estimatedMinutes": 55,
  "summary": "How to pick the right AWS analytics service: Athena for serverless SQL on S3 (and how Parquet, compression and partitions cut cost), Redshift and Spectrum for data warehousing, OpenSearch for search, EMR for Hadoop and Spark, Quick Sight for dashboards, Glue and the Data Catalog for ETL, Lake Formation for governed data lakes, Managed Service for Apache Flink and Amazon MSK for streams, and a serverless big data pipeline that ties them together.",
